  ("Exceptions: la flor ‘flower’, la labor ‘labour’. El hambre ‘hunger’ is also feminine: see 3.1.2 for an" 0.0920 0.9081 0.5838 0.6003 0.6001 0.0165 0.0062 0.3175 0.0991)
  ("explanation of the el. Forms like la calor, la color for el calor ‘heat’ and el color ‘colour’ are heard in" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6003 0.6168 0.6167 0.0165 0.0052 0.3095 0.0995)
  ("regional dialects. Pelambre ‘mop or tuft of hair’ is usually feminine, but sometimes masculine." 0.0920 0.8758 0.6168 0.6333 0.6332 0.0165 0.0046 0.3850 0.0691)
  ("(1) La radio ‘radio’ is feminine in Spain and in the Southern Cone, but in Mexico, Cuba, Central" 0.0920 0.9081 0.6455 0.6620 0.6618 0.0165 0.0056 0.3332 0.0225)
  ("America and northern parts of South America it is usually, but not always, el radio. In some places" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6620 0.6785 0.6784 0.0165 0.0041 0.3936 0.0726)
  ("el radio is ‘radio set’ and la radio is ‘radio station’. El radio also everywhere means ‘radius’ and" 0.0920 0.9081 0.6785 0.6950 0.6949 0.0165 0.0064 0.2909 0.0128)
  ("‘radium’. In García Márquez’s Noticia de un secuestro (Col., 1996) el radio and la radio are used for" 0.0920 0.9080 0.6950 0.7115 0.7114 0.0165 0.0051 0.3430 0.0788)
  ("‘radio’ with about equal frequency." 0.0920 0.3894 0.7115 0.7280 0.7280 0.0165 0.0048 0.3186 0.0558)
  ("(2) El porno is masculine even though it comes from la pornografía: detenido T., el rey del porno" 0.0920 0.9080 0.7402 0.7567 0.7565 0.0165 0.0073 0.2831 0.0225)
  ("español (El Periódico, Sp.) ‘T., king of Spanish porn, arrested’." 0.0920 0.5995 0.7567 0.7732 0.7731 0.0165 0.0048 0.3154 0.0578)
  ("1.3.5 Common masculine nouns ending in -a" 0.0920 0.6110 0.7971 0.8179 0.8179 0.0208 0.0068 0.3556 0.0541)
  ("There is no rule in Spanish that says that nouns ending in -a must be feminine. Many nouns" 0.0920 0.9080 0.8256 0.8421 0.8421 0.0165 0.0071 0.2862 0.0487)
  ("ending in -ma and several others ending in -a are masculine:" 0.0920 0.6016 0.8421 0.8586 0.8586 0.0165 0.0048 0.3270 0.0597)
  ("(a) Masculine nouns ending in -a (for masculine nouns ending in -ma see list b):" 0.0920 0.7707 0.8708 0.8873 0.8870 0.0165 0.0048 0.3477 0.0225)
  ("el alerta alert (el alerta rojo ‘red alert’ or" 0.1092 0.4309 0.9014 0.9179 0.9178 0.0165 0.0048 0.2559 0.0128)
  ("  la alerta)" 0.1092 0.1974 0.9179 0.9344 0.9343 0.0165 0.0048 0.2218 0.0332)
