  ("1.3.9 Gender of countries, provinces, regions" 0.0920 0.6138 0.2538 0.2745 0.2745 0.0208 0.0068 0.2936 0.0541)
  ("Countries, provinces, states or regions ending with an unstressed -a are almost all feminine, e.g." 0.0920 0.9043 0.2822 0.2987 0.2986 0.0165 0.0048 0.3400 0.0887)
  ("la España/Francia/Argentina de hoy" 0.1092 0.3897 0.3111 0.3273 0.3273 0.0163 0.0048 0.2711 0.0139)
  ("la conservadora Gran Bretaña" 0.1092 0.3408 0.3275 0.3438 0.3438 0.0163 0.0048 0.2540 0.0139)
  ("la Alemania que yo conocía" 0.1092 0.3200 0.3440 0.3603 0.3603 0.0163 0.0048 0.3317 0.0139)
